items.description:
The run pushed every carrier and deploy repo the sweeps touched, under Ruling D1:
- small batches, each batch's builds green and its rollouts healthy before the next;
- each class's first repo pushed alone as a canary, and each carrier's own architecture build, which runs the migrated `arch-validate`, green before the sweep continued (Ruling F5);
- the device repos last, one at a time, each waiting for its flash upload (KitchenDisplay's deploy) to succeed;
- a stop on the first red build, failed rollout or failed flash, reported to the operator.
The sweep ledger records every repo touched, its push class, the pushed sha and the outcome. No commit that is not this slice's was pushed (Ruling F1).
